      "langue": "en",
      "text": "A homebrew top-down puzzle adventure game created with NES Puzzle maker by Elvies in 2022. A free fan game of Team Cherry's Hollow Knight on the NES! Take control of a vessel and collect Grubs as per the royal decree of the Pale King! Rid Hallownest of these pesky worm and gain wealth and glory others can only dream."
